  "name": "Generate Images with Sublyx AI API (Webhook)",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "72bfb38b-c711-453e-b78c-9d85b47ffda0",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "1014fff8-d12a-43c9-be7e-e129f71fbc46",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "sublyx-image-generation",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "17605494-eb18-4592-82c9-dbc3780dc7ce",
      "name": "Generate Image (Sublyx)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.sublyx.org/v1/images/generations",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $json.body.model || \"gpt-image-2\", prompt: $json.body.prompt, size: $json.body.size || \"1024x1024\", n: 1 }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpTemplatedCustomAuth": {
          "id": "wp76AmM2mfRFxniT",
          "name": "Sublyx API (jalsmida)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "88ea74ac-3d88-48d8-bdc9-fff84af41699",
      "name": "Extract Image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        848,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const data = $json;\nconst imageUrl =\n  data?.data?.[0]?.url ||\n  data?.images?.[0]?.url ||\n  data?.output?.[0]?.url ||\n  data?.url ||\n  null;\nconst imageB64 =\n  data?.data?.[0]?.b64_json ||\n  data?.data?.[0]?.b64 ||\n  null;\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    success: Boolean(imageUrl || imageB64),\n    imageUrl,\n    imageB64,\n  },\n};"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "abee94a0-7c67-408f-b18b-f47e9ddb56f7",
      "name": "Base64 to Image File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "position": [
        1216,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "fileName": "generated-image.png",
          "mimeType": "image/png"
        },
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "imageB64"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "4b2b06dd-9873-477b-8af3-a3cc4950a2d4",
      "name": "Respond with Image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        1584,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "respondWith": "binary"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "c0d40363-b6f9-498e-8466-61f819f401e7",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -592,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 336,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## What this workflow does\n\nThis workflow receives an image prompt through a webhook, sends it to the Sublyx Images Generation API, and returns the generated image as a PNG binary response.\n\nUse this workflow to connect Sublyx image generation with your own website, application, automation, or downstream n8n workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a137aca3-3d8b-41a2-8602-d0aec11ef46f",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -96,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 336,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "## Webhook input\n\nSend a POST request with a JSON body containing a `prompt` field.\n\nOptional fields:\n\n- `model`: image model name\n- `size`: output image size\n\nExample:\n\n{\n  \"prompt\": \"A cinematic sunset over a futuristic city\",\n  \"model\": \"gpt-image-2\",\n  \"size\": \"1024x1024\"\n}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2ba530d0-6b6a-45f2-a5fc-3c265350120a",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        368,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 336,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Sublyx API configuration\n\nCreate a Sublyx API key and configure it in the n8n HTTP templated custom auth credential.\n\nThe request sends the prompt, selected model, and image size to the Sublyx Images Generation API.\n\nGet started with the [Sublyx AI API Gateway](https://sublyx.org/)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "274decad-2ed6-4b80-a6ed-396c4497e23a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        752,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 336,
        "height": 256,
        "content": "## Process the API response\n\nThe workflow checks the Sublyx response for an image URL or base64 image data.\n\nIf base64 data is returned, it is converted into a PNG binary file so the result can be downloaded or passed to another n8n node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9e826d0c-3da2-461a-a2f9-5888cd8a10f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1520,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 336,
        "height": 208,
        "content": "## Response\n\nThe workflow returns the generated image as a PNG binary response.\n\nYou can connect the response to Telegram, Discord, Google Drive, Notion, or your own application."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
